MODULE: AdmissionRawOnlyConfirmation
TARGET: DecisionEntitled
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: A coherent older materialised row hides a committed undrained higher-version pending prepare
PERTURBS: Confirm

--- FIND
    /\ sampled' = VisibleSource
--- REPLACE
    /\ sampled' = source
--- END
--- FIND
    /\ classes' = [k \in Keys |-> Classify(VisibleSource[k],k)]
    /\ horizon' = [k \in Keys |-> IF VisibleSource[k] = Newer[k] THEN 3 ELSE 2]
--- REPLACE
    /\ classes' = [k \in Keys |-> Classify(source[k],k)]
    /\ horizon' = [k \in Keys |-> IF source[k] = Newer[k] THEN 3 ELSE 2]
--- END
